. Staleness\n#     of the file is the feeder's failure signal: the fear organ\n#     v1.2 (this cycle) now checks fleet-latest mtime and fears if\n#     the composite signal is >26h old (fleet-check is meant to\n#     run at least daily).\n#\n# v1.1 (c121, same cycle): fleet-check exit-code capture moved\n#   BEFORE the heredoc-append -- v1.0 appended \"exit=$rc\" AFTER\n=== what binary does fleet-check run? ===\n2:Description=Aria fleet-check feeder (runs fleet-check, feeds fear organ)\n12:ExecStart=/bin/bash /usr/local/bin/aria-fleet-feed.sh\n13:# fleet-check runs up to ~7 min (ear check ~2min + probes); give it\n\n[t+04:53/60:00 c67/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_x6h9vedv","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/personalization\n# fleet-check.sh is fetched from personalization repo. Check if IT does password ssh to cameras:\ngrep -nE \"sshpass|ssh.*root@|dropbear\" knowledge/aria/bin/fleet-check.sh 2>/dev/null | head -10\nls knowledge/aria/bin/ | grep -i fleet"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[02:56:50] 6:#   ssh root@10.66.0.5 'bash -s' < fleet-check.sh\n107:#   ssh root@10.66.0.5 'bash -s' < fleet-check.sh\naria-fleet-feed.service\naria-fleet-feed.sh\naria-fleet-feed.timer\nfleet-check.sh\n\n[t+04:55/60:00 c68/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_isfhv8na","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/personalization\ngrep -nE \"sshpass|password|192.168.2\" knowledge/aria/bin/fleet-check.sh | head -15"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[02:56:52] 421:grab=$($P exec frigate sh -c \"timeout 25 /usr/lib/ffmpeg/7.0/bin/ffmpeg -y -loglevel error -rtsp_transport tcp -i 'rtsp://thingino:thingino@192.168.2.101/ch0' -frames:v 1 $WDIR/direct.jpg && cp $WDIR/direct.jpg /media/frigate/aria_watch_direct.jpg && echo OK\" 2>/dev/null)\n\n[t+04:57/60:00 c69/300]"}]
